{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "af4dd7d9e2c1bc698e7d63995142c0d93b2603fc5031993e4dbc1bd914bf7c0d", "ja": "『STARDOM ROAD』の他の公演のやつ。\nみんなとも見たけど、もう一回見たくて……。", "zh": "就是“STARDOM ROAD”其他公演的录像。\n虽然和大家一起看过了，但还想再看一遍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
