{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "a9ffbef38acc4e4de5c2c0ed0877f62d1fb606e9be831ec118141db791d3305d", "ja": "うん、わかってる。でも最初から見ていったほうが、\n藍がどういう子かわかるかなと思って。", "zh": "嗯，我知道。不过我觉得还是从头看起，\n才能弄清楚蓝是个怎样的孩子嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "3e2cf4df0af127c7174fc4e90ee04be128c8b296f523a9fa055151817a524bb0", "ja": "だって、メンバーは変わっても、\n藍だけはずっと『I.V.』に居続けるじゃん？", "zh": "毕竟，成员会更替，但只有藍会一直留在『I.V.』里，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "1794f93ecd04a39ae69eb507a72d5fb49d3d74d95f59f453819334b09dcc65a3", "ja": "そんな風に、強い思いを持った子を演じるんだもん。\nアタシも、体当たりでやらないと！", "zh": "要饰演这样一个怀抱强烈信念的孩子嘛。那我也得拼尽全力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bb85ea9159ee326a95e7588d91cd285c2dde1a333d75468225642c01de7e3256", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。のり子の次に藍をやる子は、\nハードルが上がりそうだな。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。继典子之后饰演蓝的孩子，恐怕会面对更高的门槛啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "4598c1adb2f331d7781092367b08444849e32f1dce652df85bf7f14beca478ed", "ja": "アタシだって、すごいプレッシャーだよ～。\n下手なことできないし、それに……。", "zh": "我也压力很大啊～。可不能表现得太差，而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e504e62ff427d5a42d642dc530a8cb62036fdb38068d1d40963153eb178feb6d", "ja": "それに？", "zh": "而且？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "7d68f8cc591cd3a81c520c227dbea7b5ea8ef2c40103938721de404185eef594", "ja": "アタシ、クールな演技の経験、少ないからさ……。\nみんなのお芝居見て、勉強させてもらおうと思って。", "zh": "我演酷帅类型的戏经验不多嘛……\n所以想看看大家的表演，好好学习一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3d17ba0afa3cf2f4c46fcd0694029c0531f56db3932e67dad2b5101ffa489272", "ja": "勉強か……。なら、直接聞いてみたらどうだ？\n奈緒とかエレナとか、喜んで話してくれそうだけど。", "zh": "学习啊……那就直接去问问看怎么样？\n奈绪或者艾莲娜，感觉她们应该都很乐意跟你聊聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "bab94b124e6762fc28ce063b3ad29bfa2077a0edf275f4fd6e55cc57a722d5b2", "ja": "ダメダメ！　最初からみんなを頼るのは、\nアタシのプライドが許さないっていうか……。", "zh": "不行不行！一开始就依赖大家的话，我的自尊心可不允许……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "d10ff87e7edd54322e29eed107042908a678625cc4475eced8586901564316a7", "ja": "仲間でライバルなのは、アタシ達も一緒！\nバシッとキメて、ビックリさせてやるんだから♪", "zh": "既是伙伴也是对手，这一点我们也一样！  \n我要好好表现，让他们大吃一惊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1016_p", "source_sha256": "50691fc754881f8328ba880e4aced33ef57147fbe7169cda0b707f10387fe644", "ja": "確かにな。……よし！　のり子が自信を持って\n藍を演じられるように、俺も手伝うよ。", "zh": "说得对。……好！我也会帮助你，让你能够充满自信地诠释藍这个角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0463_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0463_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "f38669e443b8e50705757c1b19c538644511938e49805b4fae1ebe055606c356", "ja": "ありがと、{$P$}！　じゃあさっそく\nだけど……この後の自主練、付き合ってくれるよね♪", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！那我们马上开始……接下来的自主练习，你会陪我一起吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
